n笑顔がかわいい人。\n\n衣装は袖あり、袖なしを選べます。\nポーズが選べます\n\nカエルのお友達がいます。\nカエルのお友達はオプションです。\n\n背景が透明な別バージョンも欲しいです。\n\nSNSや動画で使用したいです。\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://www.kirostyle.net/kiro.html", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poppo_tori8/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc9c6435/uploads/origins/cf836fd3-6f74-40fc-b1cc-25a2d54766d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9291221ba5ab8bb334ae3de437162819", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc9c6435/uploads/origins/cf836fd3-6f74-40fc-b1cc-25a2d54766d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9291221ba5ab8bb334ae3de437162819, https://si.imgix.net/bc9c6435/uploads/origins/cf836fd3-6f74-40fc-b1cc-25a2d54766d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dd1c7bb16cac7df7c96a4b7842cd1d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bc9c6435/uploads/origins/cf836fd3-6f74-40fc-b1cc-25a2d54766d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40d7dc820bfdd32c3f0dc36e2c237abe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello I love your artwork it is very beautiful! Please may I request artwork of mine and my friends characters, Aurelia and Aurora! vocaloid song 'GETCHA'!\n\nWe would like to use this art to post alongside the song cover we are doing!\n\nreferences: https://imgur.com/a/MxG7EJI\n\nPlease could Aurelia (green character) be in the pose on the left with green nails. Please could Aurora (pink character) be in the pose on the right with pink nails.\n\nIf possible please could you also provide a 'pink skin version' (shown in references) that we can use during chorus segments? is not possible,that is fine ^^\n\nPlease could the characters be on separate layers and on a transparent background?\n\nIf the amount is too small please feel free to counter offer ^^ Thank you for your consideration\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/MxG7EJI", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poppo_tori8/works